* ''The memory-stage hearth comes first'' (operator ruling, 2026-10-31: //"I need a locally working node+browser joined (all vessels start at anon floors, so the full rites), so you all can stop using md in an untracked scratch dir & start using the daemon wiki as a 'memory-stage' (see neuroscience + Ai developments) for all design tracking and self improvement feedback loops."//). One operator's node and browser stand joined on one machine, each from its anon floor through the full rites, and the house tracks its design and runs its feedback loops on the daemon wiki in place of untracked scratch files. The rung leads the road (#/the-attractor, #/the-order); its items read in #/stride-0-hearth. House reading: the stage runs on plain tiddlers, tags and one index view, with no embedding, no vector index and no sidecar, so the sensorium arc's deferral stands as written (#/the-road, off this road).

